<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mossimo cut near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mossimo cut near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on Mossimo Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today Mossimo said it expected its earnings per share for the third quarter to decline versus a year ago despite a 40 percent increase in quarterly sales.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed last Friday at 41.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
